  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sunil Gupta vs State Of U P And 3 Others on 16 July, 2019 Bench: Shashi Kant Gupta, Saurabh Shyam Shamshery High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 32 Case :- Writ - C No. - 22504 of 2019 Petitioner :- Sunil Gupta Respondent :- State Of U P And 3 Others",
    "facts": "A perusal of the record shows that a penalty was imposed under Section 52 of The Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (in short \"the Act\").",
    "arguments": "At the very outset, learned Standing Counsel appearing on behalf of the State raised a preliminary objection and stated that the petitioner has got an alternative remedy under Section 76 of the Act to file an appeal, as such, this writ petition is not maintainable on the ground of alternative remedy.",
